    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0169" n="79" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg79"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1300</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Harbin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moser</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-03-15T21:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1918,
                                9 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 16, 5.22 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To-day Horvat informs that Japanese Government have informally requested him to
                    take sole leadership to establish order and independent government Siberia,
                    promising him full support. Your views are requested.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moser</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
